sidered as Basic Attack DMG.\nVerina can cast Mid-air Attack: Starflower Blooms by using Basic Attack after casting Heavy Attack: Starflower Blooms.\n \nPhotosynthesis Energy\nVerina can hold up to 4 stacks of \"Photosynthesis Energy\".\nVerina obtains 1 stack of \"Photosynthesis Energy\" for every Basic Attack 5 on hit.\nVerina obtains 1 stack of \"Photosynthesis Energy\" after casting Resonance Skill Botany Experiment.\nVerina obtains 1 stack of \"Photosynthesis Energy\" after casting Intro Skill Verdant Growth.","params":[{"label":"重击·星星花绽放伤害","labelEn":"Heavy Attack: Starflower Blooms Damage","values":["32.67%+49.00%","35.35%+53.02%","38.03%+57.04%","41.78%+62.67%","44.46%+66.68%","47.54%+71.30%","51.82%+77.73%","56.11%+84.16%","60.40%+90.59%","64.95%+97.42%"]},{"label":"空中攻击·星星花绽放第一段伤害","labelEn":"Mid-air Attack: Starflower Blooms Stage 1 DMG","values":["34.02%","36.81%","39.60%","43.51%","46.30%","49.51%","53.97%","58.43%","62.90%","67.64%"]},{"label":"空中攻击·星星花绽放第二段伤害","labelEn":"Mid-air Attack: Starflower Blooms Stage 2 DMG","values":["32.10%","34.74%","37.37%","41.05%","43.69%","46.71%","50.93%","55.14%","59.35%","63.82%"]},{"label":"空中攻击·星星花绽放第三段伤害","labelEn":"Mid-air Attack: Starflower Blooms Stage 3 DMG","values":["15.34%*3","16.60%*3","17.86%*3","19.62%*3","20.88%*3","22.33%*3","24.34%*3","26.35%*3","28.36%*3","30.50%*3"]},{"label":"星星花绽放治疗量","labelEn":"Starflower Blooms Healing","values":["625+14.17%","750+16.29%","875+17.71%","1000+19.83%","1032+21.25%","1113+22.67%","1125+24.08%","1144+25.50%","1163+26.92%","1188+29.75%"]},{"label":"每层【光合能量】回复协奏能量","labelEn":"\"Photosynthesis Energy\" Concerto Regen","values":["12","12","12","12","12","12","12","12","12","12"]}],"hits":[{"label":"重击·星星花绽放伤害","labelEn":"Heavy Attack: Starflower Blooms Damage","term":0,"count":1,"multiplier":[0.3267,0.3535,0.3803,0.4178,0.4446,0.4754,0.5182,0.5611,0.604,0.6495],"damageId":1503608014,"type":"heavy","typeId":1,"typeName":"重击","calc":"damage","element":"spectro","elementId